1. Obfuscate timing mechanisms using modular arithmetic:
We'll use the provided formula to obfuscate the timing mechanisms. This will ensure that the timing is not predictable.

```cpp
unsigned int obfuscateTiming(unsigned int dwStoreParameter) {
    constexpr unsigned int dayInMilliseconds = 86400 * 1000;
    unsigned int dwTotalMilliseconds = (20 * 100) + (dwStoreParameter % dayInMilliseconds);
    return dwTotalMilliseconds;
